      "value": "@{59c0e5cd39a9874475bcbfd7|full_name}: I sell avatars from my world. Most want little changes make them Unique, also I mentioned to them that they can favorite them in an upcoming patch but they still wished to buy them for convenience sake. Plus they can use their favorites on avatar worlds that have people they can't buy from or contact.",
