  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since there is an upcoming ability to favorite avatars from worlds, it might be an idea to have and option in the sdk to prevent an avatar from being favorited from a pedestal. I know a few friends who have their avatars on pedestals so friends can borrow them for a period, but they don't like the idea of anybody being able to save them for future use without their permission.",
